{"src":"en","tgt":"ko","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ko","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8170.216864,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8830.226408,"text":"하지만 선전 구역은 이 점에서 어느 정도 한 국가처럼 작동합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":8919.191478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8923.000455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8925.992456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8926.680215,"samples":14266,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":15116.909256,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":15822.345803999999,"text":"메카 북쪽 산 중 하나의 정상에 위치한 이 동굴은 밀접하게"},{"kind":"audio","t":15910.569966000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15911.767546000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15913.479728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":15914.228486000002,"samples":18167,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":17740.965125000002,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18091.455951000004,"text":"세상과 격리되어 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":18136.693268000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18137.486995,"samples":17944,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":26291.962207999997,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27142.702660000003,"text":"이제 사람들은 연필깎이 근처에 갈 필요 없이 컴퓨터 화면에 메시지를 씁니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":27276.378466000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27278.054028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27279.778,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27281.686178000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27282.236818999998,"samples":11034,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":37547.547977,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":38952.653909,"text":"세금이 높은 국가로 여행하는 여행객들은 때때로 상당한 금액의 돈을 절약할 수 있으며, 특히 주류나 담배와 같은 제품에서 그러합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":39191.077164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39195.965174000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39201.10041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39206.328944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39211.736265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39216.917870000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39221.980367000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39224.929638,"samples":22792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":45788.741456,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46476.267518,"text":"식물은 광합성을 통해 태양으로부터 양분을 만듭니다. 그것들은 그늘도 제공합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":46563.884620000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46568.76687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46573.540361,"samples":29758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":46580.34913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46584.482062,"samples":26582,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"input","t":58078.227901,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59532.503606,"text":"병원은 다른 사람으로의 감염 가능성을 방지하기 위해 환자를 격리하는 것을 포함하여 감염 관리를 위한 프로토콜을 준수했습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":59708.976938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59710.760559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59711.879721000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59713.328697000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59714.94215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59716.408396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":59718.02076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":59718.306655,"samples":4681,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68180.723302,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":69417.795772,"text":"수행된 작업은 대부분 이론적이었으나, 프로그램은 궁수자리 은하에서 이루어진 관측 결과를 시뮬레이션하기 위해 작성되었습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":69604.516706,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":69609.95176699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69615.072733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69620.282608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69625.366834,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69630.693437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69635.096104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69637.362537,"samples":23071,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":78311.487238,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":79596.897025,"text":"바르셀로나의 공식 언어는 카탈루냐어와 스페인어입니다. 약 절반은 카탈루냐어로 말하는 것을 선호하고, 대다수는 이를 이해하며, 거의 모든 사람이 스페인어를 압니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":79698.816192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79700.71716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79702.86433499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":79703.18342999999,"samples":3956,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":79755.243305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79756.955947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79758.59365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79760.46766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":79762.460117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79764.138429,"samples":31764,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":84130.247538,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":85288.43190299999,"text":"어떤 지역에서는 물을 1분 동안 끓이는 것으로 충분하지만, 다른 지역에서는 몇 분 더 끓여야 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":85423.147342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85427.956133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85433.255716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85438.359682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85443.490758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85446.44548899999,"samples":18947,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":89856.745082,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":91132.10910399999,"text":"식물은 자연 환경에 있을 때 가장 아름다우므로, 단 한 줄기라도 꺾고 싶은 유혹을 참으세요."},{"kind":"audio","t":91253.03809799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91257.864059,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91263.13831299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91268.249919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91272.193284,"samples":24966,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":97709.602357,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98740.01487999999,"text":"1920년대 동안 대부분의 시민과 국가들의 지배적인 태도는 평화주의와 고립주의였습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":98862.57114799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98863.711539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98865.217584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98866.649811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98868.306004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":98868.570759,"samples":3343,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103528.526564,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104696.715975,"text":"마사 세리프는 당대의 최상위 포식자였기에, 다른 모술 외에는 아무것도 두려워하지 않았습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":104826.914137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104828.08541799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104829.44396599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104831.00353,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104832.39153699999,"samples":29702,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":113140.20324199999,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114452.51490699999,"text":"1537년 아순시온의 설립 이후, 파라과이는 원주민으로서의 성격과 정체성을 상당 부분 유지해 왔습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":114624.52178299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114625.86443199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114627.09180099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114628.74567399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114630.338708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":114631.932022,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114632.584491,"samples":18780,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":119868.47868999999,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":120838.660292,"text":"이 질병은 돼지에 의해 전파되며, 이후 모기를 통해 인간에게 옮겨갑니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":120933.530824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120934.882312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":120936.511845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120937.910252,"samples":27919,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":129360.64851099999,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130350.97008199999,"text":"대부분의 현대 연구 망원경은 대기 조건이 유리한 외딴 지역에 위치한 거대한 시설입니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":130476.527741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130481.39900099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":130486.766813,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130491.94127799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130497.18458199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":130497.469537,"samples":2229,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":135278.71493,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136227.222178,"text":"여행자에게는 인내심과 이해심 또한 필요하다는 점을 사람들은 예상하지 못할 수도 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":136345.26312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136350.244218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136355.57426999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136360.749875,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136364.541423,"samples":23851,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":140540.003762,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141376.531898,"text":"따라서 그 표기는 단순히 라벨로 추가되었을 가능성이 큽니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":141470.940928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141476.03841399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141481.228979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141484.550345,"samples":22068,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":147823.11195999998,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148415.556704,"text":"하지만 새들에게는 여전히 공룡처럼 보이는 점들이 많습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":148500.4234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148505.40364899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148510.655582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":148510.968917,"samples":2284,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":155183.185205,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":156212.91073899998,"text":"그곳들은 거의 모두 수영하기 안전한 모래사장이며, 대부분은 ~가 제공하는 그늘이 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":156342.520572,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156347.420051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156352.869622,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156358.117876,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156363.490107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156364.366773,"samples":9473,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":157898.771192,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158179.579441,"text":"포히칸 나무들이."},{"kind":"audio","t":158219.093723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158219.450437,"samples":6798,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":164345.808166,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165545.532479,"text":"성인 자녀 둘을 둔 기혼자인 듀발은 이야기를 전해 들은 밀러에게 큰 인상을 남기지 못했습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":165695.517577,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165700.617553,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165705.467663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":165710.56396,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165715.759545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165717.366298,"samples":12260,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"close","t":175805.493145,"code":1005}]}